# Dependency directories
**/node_modules
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*

# Environment and sensitive files
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# Git and version control
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.github

# Docker files
**/Dockerfile*
**/.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml

# Documentation and testing
**/README.md
**/docs
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output
**/tests
**/*.test.js
**/*.spec.js

# Build outputs (if building locally)
**/build
**/dist

# Nginx temporary/log files
**/nginx/logs
**/nginx/*.log
